.TH NEO-VOICE 1 "2026-11-24" "gnome-phone" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-voice \- wake word detections app for GNOME Phone's assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-voice
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists the wake word detections the voice service of Minerva keeps (its detection log, through the session service
org.minerva.Voice1): listen to a detection, label it as right or wrong, trim its clip.
.SH SEE ALSO
minerva-voice(1)
